# Parameterized type alias basic usage
# [type [let a b] Body] declares a type alias with parameters
# Constructor usage should work, but @[Alias T1 T2] instantiation is not yet implemented

[
  Pair: [type [let a b] [Pair first: a  second: b]]
  int-str: [Pair first: 42  second: "hello"]
]
int-str.first
=== error
[E020] arity mismatch: expected 1 argument, got 2 (defined at 1:1-1:1)
  in materialized at 4:1-7:2

=== warn
type alias 'Pair' expects 2 type parameter(s), got 0 at 5:25-5:51
